    "title": "LIST OF ABBREVIATIONS AND ACRONYMS",
    "text": "AU BVAS CBOs CD CSOs CVR EC 8A EC8B EC8D EL EM EMB EMBs EOLC EOPs EP ERM EVMAT ICCES Security ICT IDP IDPs",
    "page": 8,
